 HISTORY                                                          8310 1451
 -------                                                          8310 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8310 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8310 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium     8310 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics  8310 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub       8310 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in   8310 1451
 UN (U 10% enrichment) [3]. MAT=8310 and ZA=8410 are used for U in8310 1451
 UN (U 10% enrichment).                                           8310 1451
